.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-stem-verify 1  "xil-stem-verify " 
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-verify \- Scan a stems folder and produce a JSON report with file attributes and Whisper transcriptions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-stem\-verify\fR [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-stems\-dir\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-whisper\-python\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-\-language\fR] [\fB\-\-beam\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-transcribe\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scan a stems folder and produce a JSON report with file attributes and Whisper transcriptions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SLUG>\fR
Show slug (default: resolved from project.json or XIL_PROJECTROOT)
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Episode tag, e.g. S01E01 (required unless \-\-stems\-dir is set)
.TP
\fB\-\-stems\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Override stems directory (default: <workspace>/stems/<slug>/<episode>/)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Output JSON path (default: <workspace>/parsed/<slug>/stem_verify_<episode>.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-whisper\-python\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to venv\-whisper Python executable (auto\-detected if omitted)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<SIZE>\fR [default: large\-v3\-turbo]
Whisper model size: tiny|base|small|medium|large\-v3|large\-v3\-turbo (default: large\-v3\-turbo)
.TP
\fB\-\-language\fR \fI<LANG>\fR [default: en]
Language hint for Whisper. Use \*(Aqauto\*(Aq for automatic detection (default: en)
.TP
\fB\-\-beam\-size\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 5]
Whisper beam size (default: 5)
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<DEVICE>\fR [default: cuda]
Compute device for Whisper (default: cuda)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
cuda
.IP \(bu 2
cpu
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-transcribe\fR
Skip Whisper transcription; output file attributes only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
